{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "61", "x": 0.9080829955905043, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.0256602530131315, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Questions 33-37", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.1613150258338729, "w": 0.17866854533392018, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Complete the summary using the list of phrases, A-H, below.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.19958322765056533, "w": 0.5991992237220598, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Calls by the umpire", "x": 0.4167338461426473, "y": 0.2589138479607589, "w": 0.2071305490221529, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Even after ABS was developed, MLB still wanted human umpires to shout out", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.27912338576958956, "w": 0.8068326832738637, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "decisions as they had in their 33 ............ . The umpire's job had, at one", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.3074537358437272, "w": 0.8075754765641796, "h": 0.018822616509687834, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "time, required a 34 ............ about whether a ball was a strike. A ball is", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.33578406705716857, "w": 0.8072687219023956, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "considered a strike when the batter does not hit it and it crosses through a 35 ............", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.3641144171313062, "w": 0.8077089640540335, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "…………………… extending approximately from the batter's knee to his chest.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.3924448426482289, "w": 0.7590964496326172, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "In the past, 36 ............ over strike calls were not uncommon, but today", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.42077519272236646, "w": 0.8073580211371596, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "everyone accepts the complete ban on pushing or shoving the umpire. One", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.4491055805178966, "w": 0.7605073980468792, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "difference, however, is that during the first game DeJesus used ABS, strike calls", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.4774606758255214, "w": 0.8075534336991116, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "were met with 37 ............", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.505791025899659, "w": 0.30809527807997006, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": ".", "x": 0.4796243957307379, "y": 0.505791025899659, "w": 0.010127825036655234, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "A", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5918204328937182, "w": 0.026410812568698126, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "pitch boundary", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.5918204328937182, "w": 0.1579239409402953, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "B", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6201507829678558, "w": 0.025604517885119353, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "numerous disputes", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.6201507829678558, "w": 0.19884311098439028, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "C", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6484811330419934, "w": 0.026007671634718354, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "team tactics", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.6484811330419934, "w": 0.13166914572004967, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "D", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6768486764091467, "w": 0.026209235693898627, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "subjective assessment", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.6768486764091467, "w": 0.23573082042621057, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "E", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7051789510404993, "w": 0.024596659142360307, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "widespread approval", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.7051789510404993, "w": 0.2171861836757103, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "F", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.733509376557422, "w": 0.023991941333581034, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "former roles", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.733509376557422, "w": 0.13086286385209012, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "G", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7618397266315596, "w": 0.0270155303774774, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "total silence", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.7618397266315596, "w": 0.13086286385209012, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "H", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7900217561903445, "w": 0.027620248186256673, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "perceived area", "x": 0.154847807857574, "y": 0.7900217561903445, "w": 0.1557066337643585, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}